 not business code — architecture-level interfaces are allowed (I don't write business code). Keep ~150 lines.

Order state machine design:

```java
public interface StateMachine<S extends Enum<S>, E extends Enum<E>> {
  TransitionResult<S> fire(S current, E event, TransitionContext ctx);
  boolean canFire(S current, E event);
  Set<E> eventsFrom(S state);
}
```
`TableStateMachine` built by `TransitionTable.builder().from(Pending).on(CONFIRM).to(Confirmed).guard(...).action(...).build()`.

Persistence: `OrderStateService.transition(orderId, event, actor, reason)`:
1. load order (must exist; else 404)
